# Plan → Dev Handoff

## Status Check
- [x] Story has [READY] status
- [x] DoR completed at `@shared/templates/definition-of-ready.md`
- [x] AC follows `@shared/templates/acceptance-criteria.md`

## Dev Actions
1. Read story from `docs/requirements/{story-name}.md`
2. Create prompt at `development/prompts/prompt-{story-name}.md`
3. Use `@dev/rules/paths.md` for file locations
4. Follow `@dev/rules/base.md` standards

## Handoff Complete
Update status to [IN_PROGRESS] when started.